(7636234, 1238845, 173844, '<td valign="top">Personal favorite of the challenge.  It pieces together so beautifully --  subtle lines, multiple planes like facets, light pushing through in all corners, the improper white balance enhancing the sense of night.  And a bunny rabbit floating about in zero gravity in the lower right.  Fine title. The "minty rain" is sprinkles on the ice cream cone.  A visual feast.</td>', 'Personal favorite of the challenge.  It pieces together so beautifully --  subtle lines, multiple planes like facets, light pushing through in all corners, the improper white balance enhancing the sense of night.  And a bunny rabbit floating about in zero gravity in the lower right.  Fine title. The "minty rain" is sprinkles on the ice cream cone.  A visual feast.', '2019-07-26 08:47:45.000000', NULL, 0),
