(7636308, 1238837, 24454, '<td valign="top">I also think this looks like a painting!  Such pretty light!  Its hard to imagine the correct white balance making this better!  Its perfect!</td>', 'I also think this looks like a painting!  Such pretty light!  Its hard to imagine the correct white balance making this better!  Its perfect!', '2019-07-27 01:10:02.000000', NULL, 0),
