(7636310, 1238821, 24454, '<td valign="top">I hate it when that happens!  It has happened to me so many times!  I wish we could only vote once.  Im glad that late vote-changer didnt take the honorable mention away from you!  This is so pretty in that soft blue light!</td>', 'I hate it when that happens!  It has happened to me so many times!  I wish we could only vote once.  Im glad that late vote-changer didnt take the honorable mention away from you!  This is so pretty in that soft blue light!', '2019-07-27 01:16:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7636311, 1238840, 24454, '<td valign="top">I think this is so pretty!  Like a burst of light in that dreamy blue!  Surely the proper white balance wouldnt have been as lovely as this!</td>', 'I think this is so pretty!  Like a burst of light in that dreamy blue!  Surely the proper white balance wouldnt have been as lovely as this!', '2019-07-27 01:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
